Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Draft coordinated changes to pages, examples, tests, and release notes according to the reviewed repair direction. Preserve unaffected claims, update cross-links and terminology, and keep code examples executable under their stated environment.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
